{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dart Racer is an arcade racing game set in a futuristic galaxy obsessed with speed. Master the controls, fine-tune your dart, and compete in races across a variety of curious environments. Developed with flat and VR modes in mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race in Galactic Cup!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the intense championship races of the Galactic Cup, propelling your career forward and unlocking new races and darts. These thrilling interstellar competitions test your skills and push you to outperform rivals, offering a competitive environment for aspiring racers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2401910/extras/dbce8a680c0601332c91f5a3668fc8b4.poster.avif?t=1769735334\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2401910/extras/dbce8a680c0601332c91f5a3668fc8b4.webm?t=1769735334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2401910/extras/dbce8a680c0601332c91f5a3668fc8b4.mp4?t=1769735334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tune Up Your Dart!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your dart to meet the challenges ahead. Enhance its speed, acceleration, boost\u00a0and handling by upgrading its\u00a0components. Continuously optimizing your dart's performance is essential to stay competitive in the Galactic Cup.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2401910/extras/4c5498ccd57076613e9fcf10cbb2cd6c.poster.avif?t=1769735334\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2401910/extras/4c5498ccd57076613e9fcf10cbb2cd6c.webm?t=1769735334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2401910/extras/4c5498ccd57076613e9fcf10cbb2cd6c.mp4?t=1769735334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize Your Dart!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Express your style by customizing your dart. Choose from a variety of darts and freely change\u00a0colors\u00a0to make it stand out on the racetrack. Personalize your dart to reflect your racing identity and showcase your creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2401910/extras/b2ad672109866298768df4aeb625779f.poster.avif?t=1769735334\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2401910/extras/b2ad672109866298768df4aeb625779f.webm?t=1769735334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2401910/extras/b2ad672109866298768df4aeb625779f.mp4?t=1769735334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the Controls!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become proficient in the unique VR controls of the dart or use more familiar flat controls. Master the intricacies of managing thrust, boosting, and executing advanced maneuvers. By honing your control skills, you can navigate challenging tracks, overtake opponents, and maintain optimal path throughout the races.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2401910?t=1769735334","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2